1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,400
Taxmin qiling! Uyingizgacha qanchaga tushadi?

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:05,900
Uch… ikki… bir…

3
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:07,900
Javob — bitta skrinshotda.

4
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:09,900
Bu — Pochtam.

5
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:13,900
Rasmini yuklang — sun'iy intellekt tovarni topadi.

6
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:18,900
Narxni skrinshot qiling — jami summa boj, kargo va kurs bilan tayyor.

7
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:21,900
Oyiga ikki yuz dollargacha — bojsiz.

8
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:24,900
Butun savatni ham — bitta skrinshotda.

9
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:28,400
Eng arzon kuryer — u siz uchun sotib oladi.

10
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:31,900
Qo'llanma va jo'natmani kuzatish.

11
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:34,900
Qirq uch do'kon. Yigirma kuryer. Uch til.

12
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:37,900
Hammasi — bitta ilovada.

13
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:40,900
Orzuingiz — eshigingiz oldida.

14
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:44,400
Hoziroq sinab ko'ring — Pochtam nuqta uz.
